  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:15:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. So I was driving home Wednesday night from my sister's, it was dark, and I take the same route every time, and there's a stretch where the road has been patched and re-patched. Anyway, I hit a pothole and my tire blew out. The rim is bent too. So, does the city reimburse for car damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. I can take a report on the pothole now. Where exactly is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 382 Bridge Street, in the Point. Right by the curb on the street side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 382 Bridge Street, in front of the house, near the curb. Tire blown and the rim bent. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:16:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And sorry, I'm looking at my to-do list, it's taped to the wall here, it's a long one, and this is the top item now. Is there a reference number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll give you one once I log it. On the damage, that's handled as a separate claim. I'll send your information to the right office and they'll tell you the process."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:16:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. My number is 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:16:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. Your reference number is 4471. Let me read it back. Four, four, seven, one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:16:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four seven one. Great, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T13:16:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
